   "text": "If one of the 3 middle steps is slow or fails, the check still finishes — just with a note saying that part is a partial result.\nOnly the last step (\"write the verdict\") has no fallback: if that fails, the whole check fails and the person can retry.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
