   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "If one of the 3 middle steps is slow or fails, the check still finishes — just with a note saying that part is a partial result.\nOnly the last step (\"write the verdict\") has no fallback: if that fails, the whole check fails and the person can retry.",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
